                    (rect3 100 200 300 400 5 2)

          And they will appear on Magic 6 like this

                    call plzt$zap
                    call plzt$zap
                    call plzt$rect3 -fb 100 -fb 200 -fb 300 -fb 400 -fb 5 -fb 2

